OL,3,GNEWSANursing union 'dissatisfied' with
OL,4,Asafe staffing legislation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal College of Nursing has said
OL,7,Fit is "extremely dissatisfied" with
OL,8,Fproposed legislation to strengthen safe
OL,9,Fstaffing across health and social care
OL,10,Fservices in Northern Ireland.
OL,12,FHealth minister Robbie Butler
OL,13,Fintroduced the Health and Social Care
OL,14,F(Staffing) bill in the assembly on
OL,15,FMonday, saying it marked a "significant
OL,16,Fstep".
OL,18,FBut a letter to the department from the
OL,19,FRCN's director Rita Devlin, seen by BBC
OL,20,FNews NI, spelled out the nursing
OL,21,Funion's concerns with the legislation.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
