OL,3,GNEWSANursing union 'dissatisfied' with
OL,4,Asafe staffing legislation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are already laws in Scotland and
OL,7,FWales that place legal duties on NHS
OL,8,Ftrusts to calculate and maintain safe
OL,9,Fstaffing levels.
